# Model weights go in this directory.
#
# Kept under app/ so the runtime image picks them up: the Dockerfile's final
# stage copies app/ and sql/ and nothing else, so a folder at
# the repository root would never reach the deployed container.
#
# Before committing anything large, see ../README.md — files over ~50 MB need
# Git LFS or a download-at-startup approach rather than going straight into
# the repository.
